{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85f93424008eb0ca9510de951f639a84","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sunset Love where did you get your maracas from that they are to small? &amp;nbsp;I was going to order the medium size ones from Amols but don&#039;t want them to be to tiny&lt;img id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1334766330372_163\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/confused.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608789,"PostDate":1334770004,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sunset Love where did you get your maracas from that they are to small? \u00a0I was going to order the medium size ones from Amols but don't want them to be to tiny<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1334766330372_163\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/confused.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309491991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bb9d53e6e15659d57725229901e6758","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]stella331[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sunset Love where did you get your maracas from that they are to small?  I was going to order the medium size ones from Amols but don&#039;t want them to be to tiny[img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/confused.gif[\/img][\/quote] \n \n \n \n Haha, well I got the Painted Tropical Mini Maracas from Oriental Trading...somehow the name didn&#039;t give it away for me...I can claim it was a blonde moment right? LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":1608800,"PostDate":1334771081,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>stella331<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sunset Love where did you get your maracas from that they are to small? \u00a0I was going to order the medium size ones from Amols but don't want them to be to tiny<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1334766330372_163\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/confused.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Haha, well I got the Painted Tropical Mini Maracas from Oriental Trading...somehow the name didn't give it away for me...I can claim it was a blonde moment right? LOL<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16da6f8b20c70c9ae3bcbbfb5ca43b57","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Jill Conner[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Wow!  That is A LOT of work to get the DJ some decent music!  I applaud your effort!  We&#039;re just bailing!!  ... We&#039;re going to rent the sound system, but mainly because I think a few of our guests will actually ENJOY playing DJ for the night!!  \n \n We also own this: \n \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.bose.com\/controller?url=\/shop_online\/digital_music_systems\/sounddock_systems\/sounddock_portable\/index.jsp\"]http:\/\/www.bose.com\/controller?url=\/shop_online\/digital_music_systems\/sounddock_systems\/sounddock_portable\/index.jsp[\/url] \n \n For anyone concerned about the $500 charge for the \"sound system\", consider this an option.  It&#039;s $400, and it&#039;s AWESOME.  I got it for my fiance last year for a Christmas present, and we use it ALL THE TIME. We&#039;re actually considering using this instead of the sound system they provide, but we&#039;re not sure.  \n \n Thanks again for all the advise about the welcome dinner and the substitutions on the reception menu.  All things I did not know or think to ask!  You ladies are so helpful!  We&#039;ll probably be picking our meal soon.  That is smart about bailing on the soup I think... does seem like a rather warm dish for the summer!  And just to make this clear (it really wasn&#039;t so when I talked to Gloria), if we do a \"welcome dinner\", we have to have a SET menu still?  Gloria did send me some Menus from Agave and Toscana, but I thought it was mainly to determine which restaurant we wanted to have our welcome dinner at!?  Not to pick another SET menu!?  Bah!  I agree that our guests are paying thousands of dollars to come to the resort to celebrate with us... I want them to have SOME choice in what they eat for the few days they&#039;re there!  That is why we wanted an all-inclusive resort!!!! \n \n Reception on the beach sounds like it will be amazing!  How fun to have the whole sha-bang when you get home too.  We&#039;re doing a WAY more informal at-home-reception a month after we return... we&#039;re doing a picnic-style Saturday afternoon fiesta with food, drinks, and other outdoor activity! \n \n And no, I don&#039;t think it&#039;s tacky at all not to have a guest book... not sure we&#039;re doing one ourselves... just thought I&#039;d get an opinion out there! \n \n I think, overall, we&#039;re VERY lucky ladies!!!  Like many posters say, our weddings will be beautiful no matter what!!!  We&#039;ll be in Mexico after all, right!?  Also, I think by nature, none of us could possibly be TOO BIG of control freaks... our we wouldn&#039;t be having a destination-style wedding in the first place!! \n[\/quote] \n \n Wow, I may have to look into that Bose! It would probably be perfect for us! \n \n I actually think your picnic-style sounds AMAZING! My family was all kind of bummed that we were doing a DW so I felt like I needed to have something formal at home. My fiance and I are both super laid back and would far prefer something like you are doing, that just sounds awesome! \n \n I also agree, we are very lucky! We&#039;ll have to share pics once our fabulous weddings are over!","Attachments":[],"Id":1608802,"PostDate":1334771322,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Jill Conner<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wow! \u00a0That is A LOT of work to get the DJ some decent music! \u00a0I applaud your effort! \u00a0We're just bailing!! \u00a0... We're going to rent the sound system, but mainly because I think a few of our guests will actually ENJOY playing DJ for the night!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We also own this:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bose.com\/controller?url=\/shop_online\/digital_music_systems\/sounddock_systems\/sounddock_portable\/index.jsp' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bose.com\/...table\/index.jsp<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For anyone concerned about the $500 charge for the \"sound system\", consider this an option. \u00a0It's $400, and it's AWESOME. \u00a0I got it for my fiance last year for a Christmas present, and we use it ALL THE TIME. We're actually considering using this instead of the sound system they provide, but we're not sure.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again for all the advise about the welcome dinner and the substitutions on the reception menu. \u00a0All things I did not know or think to ask! \u00a0You ladies are so helpful! \u00a0We'll probably be picking our meal soon. \u00a0That is smart about bailing on the soup I think... does seem like a rather warm dish for the summer! \u00a0And just to make this clear (it really wasn't so when I talked to Gloria), if we do a \"welcome dinner\", we have to have a SET menu still? \u00a0Gloria did send me some Menus from Agave and Toscana, but I thought it was mainly to determine which restaurant we wanted to have our welcome dinner at!? \u00a0Not to pick another SET menu!? \u00a0Bah! \u00a0I agree that our guests are paying thousands of dollars to come to the resort to celebrate with us... I want them to have SOME choice in what they eat for the few days they're there! \u00a0That is why we wanted an all-inclusive resort!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Reception on the beach sounds like it will be amazing! \u00a0How fun to have the whole sha-bang when you get home too. \u00a0We're doing a WAY more informal at-home-reception a month after we return... we're doing a picnic-style Saturday afternoon fiesta with food, drinks, and other outdoor activity!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And no, I don't think it's tacky at all not to have a guest book... not sure we're doing one ourselves... just thought I'd get an opinion out there!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I think, overall, we're VERY lucky ladies!!! \u00a0Like many posters say, our weddings will be beautiful no matter what!!! \u00a0We'll be in Mexico after all, right!? \u00a0Also, I think by nature, none of us could possibly be TOO BIG of control freaks... our we wouldn't be having a destination-style wedding in the first place!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Wow, I may have to look into that Bose! It would probably be perfect for us!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I actually think your picnic-style sounds AMAZING! My family was all kind of bummed that we were doing a DW so I felt like I needed to have something formal at home. My fiance and I are both super laid back and would far prefer something like you are doing, that just sounds awesome!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also agree, we are very lucky! We'll have to share pics once our fabulous weddings are over!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleynchristian@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311633878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunsetLove","Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1bb692fc57fa86cc50c615627623209","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ohhh ok lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608825,"PostDate":1334775509,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ohhh ok lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309491991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b6c95e7634c66daaad6e40156dda831","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Ladies! I have not gone through everything everyone has said, but I did get married here on 09\/17\/2011. Everything was wonderful and I worked with Nayeli. We had a very small wedding, but I wouldn&#039;t have had it any other way or any other place. I did my own makeup, but had my hair done there. The price was, I believe, $60 and it was GREAT! She worked so very hard on it and it did not BUDGE! For our reception, we had the French restaurant (Chez Isabelle) reserved for us (it was closed that night) and picked our menu. It was absolutely perfect, very private, and the service and food was great. We live in Nashville, TN and we flew our own photographer in.&lt;img alt=\"IMG_2856.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800716\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_2874.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800720\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_2670.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800707\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_3171.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800731\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_3290.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800733\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608862,"PostDate":1334780064,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies! I have not gone through everything everyone has said, but I did get married here on 09\/17\/2011. Everything was wonderful and I worked with Nayeli. We had a very small wedding, but I wouldn't have had it any other way or any other place. I did my own makeup, but had my hair done there. The price was, I believe, $60 and it was GREAT! She worked so very hard on it and it did not BUDGE! For our reception, we had the French restaurant (Chez Isabelle) reserved for us (it was closed that night) and picked our menu. It was absolutely perfect, very private, and the service and food was great. We live in Nashville, TN and we flew our own photographer in.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_2856.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800716\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_2874.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800720\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_2670.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800707\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_3171.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800731\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_3290.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800733\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hlsaylors@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305057612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239835.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bridetobe11","Id":239835,"Name":"bridetobe11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"814375870447b5f6d8f3cd640a2e1004","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello ladies!! I have not read everything through this thread, but I just wanted to say I got married here on 9\/17\/2011. When I was planning my wedding, this website helped me a lot, so I want to return the favor. Everything was perfect and I would not have changed a thing. My wedding was extremely small, but was wonderful. My husband and I arrived one day before our wedding, and had a meeting almost immediately with Gloria. Gloria is SUPER sweet, but my main wedding planner I worked with was Nayeli. This day I chose the color for the sashes on the chairs and my cake. I had originally chosen a different cake, but was notified they could do something different once I got there, so I chose a white cake with real strawberry filling between layers. It was absolutely delicious. I also asked to have roses matching my bouquet on top of the cake. We had our reception in the French restaurant (Chez Isabelle) and picked our whole menu. It was closed that day, so it was reserved only for us, which I really enjoyed and felt was very special and intimate. The food was absolutely delicious. We (my husband and I) were at least 30 minutes late to the reception due to taking pictures, but they did not seem irritated in the slightest and the service was top notch. When we got back to our room, it was decorated with roses, chilled champagne, and fresh fruit, as well as a \"honeymooners\" sash on our door. Literally, almost every door you walked past said \"anniversary\" or \"honeymoon.\" Everything was great and we truly enjoyed not only our wedding, but our entire stay here!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608869,"PostDate":1334780999,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello ladies!! I have not read everything through this thread, but I just wanted to say I got married here on 9\/17\/2011. When I was planning my wedding, this website helped me a lot, so I want to return the favor. Everything was perfect and I would not have changed a thing. My wedding was extremely small, but was wonderful. My husband and I arrived one day before our wedding, and had a meeting almost immediately with Gloria. Gloria is SUPER sweet, but my main wedding planner I worked with was Nayeli. This day I chose the color for the sashes on the chairs and my cake. I had originally chosen a different cake, but was notified they could do something different once I got there, so I chose a white cake with real strawberry filling between layers. It was absolutely delicious. I also asked to have roses matching my bouquet on top of the cake. We had our reception in the French restaurant (Chez Isabelle) and picked our whole menu. It was closed that day, so it was reserved only for us, which I really enjoyed and felt was very special and intimate. The food was absolutely delicious. We (my husband and I) were at least 30 minutes late to the reception due to taking pictures, but they did not seem irritated in the slightest and the service was top notch. When we got back to our room, it was decorated with roses, chilled champagne, and fresh fruit, as well as a \"honeymooners\" sash on our door. Literally, almost every door you walked past said \"anniversary\" or \"honeymoon.\" Everything was great and we truly enjoyed not only our wedding, but our entire stay here!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hlsaylors@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305057612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239835.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bridetobe11","Id":239835,"Name":"bridetobe11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d4e51d2d79038a3f52dfde9574ab139","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here are some pictures from our special day! We are from Nashville, TN and flew in our own photographer. Also, forgot to note, I had my hair done at the spa and she did such an amazing job and was VERY meticulous. I had champagne while I got my hair done and they also brought me chocolate covered strawberries. My hair did not BUDGE and I loved it so much. I did my own makeup.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_2661.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800755\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_2670.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800759\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_2856.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800766\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_3171.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800781\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_3290.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800784\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"IMG_2874.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800786\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;img alt=\"IMG_3422.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800794\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608875,"PostDate":1334782110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here are some pictures from our special day! We are from Nashville, TN and flew in our own photographer. Also, forgot to note, I had my hair done at the spa and she did such an amazing job and was VERY meticulous. I had champagne while I got my hair done and they also brought me chocolate covered strawberries. My hair did not BUDGE and I loved it so much. I did my own makeup.<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_2661.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800755\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_2670.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800759\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_2856.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800766\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_3171.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800781\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_3290.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800784\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_2874.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800786\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_3422.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/800794\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hlsaylors@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305057612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239835.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bridetobe11","Id":239835,"Name":"bridetobe11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95ae2d4773d1daf095c6d597b582a622","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Bridetobe11 thank you so much for sharing pics:) &amp;nbsp;Do you remember who did your hair at the spa?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1609127,"PostDate":1334847520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Bridetobe11 thank you so much for sharing pics:) \u00a0Do you remember who did your hair at the spa?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309491991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"27cadea18f0d117f0cf3bef7671527b8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Bridetobe11... I also thank you for sharing your pictures!! &amp;nbsp;Looks beautiful, and makes me even more excited for my own wedding in two months!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Your hair looks great! &amp;nbsp;Did the wedding coordinators book your appointment @ the spa? &amp;nbsp;Or did you contact the spa yourself?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1609514,"PostDate":1334905418,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Bridetobe11... I also thank you for sharing your pictures!! \u00a0Looks beautiful, and makes me even more excited for my own wedding in two months!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Your hair looks great! \u00a0Did the wedding coordinators book your appointment @ the spa? \u00a0Or did you contact the spa yourself?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jconner17@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323641154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248531.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jill Conner","Id":248531,"Name":"Jill Conner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c73997f9aa1e0708f88bb95ae3af2640","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Welcome drinks... that is a good idea too...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do you guys have itineraries for your guests? &amp;nbsp;I haven&#039;t put much thought into this to be honest... but now I am starting to wonder how you communicate with everyone! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m assuming there will not be normal cell phone coverage! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How are all you ladies working out this communication piece?! &amp;nbsp;Now I&#039;m wondering how we even figure out who is in what room, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, none of the planners have mentioned a \"rehearsal\" to me... anyone doing one of these? &amp;nbsp;Or are these normal?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Apparently you all have become my wedding planners... I suppose Gloria will appreciate not getting bombarded with 400 emails from me with 1 question in each! ahah!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1609515,"PostDate":1334905733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Welcome drinks... that is a good idea too...\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you guys have itineraries for your guests? \u00a0I haven't put much thought into this to be honest... but now I am starting to wonder how you communicate with everyone! \u00a0I'm assuming there will not be normal cell phone coverage! \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How are all you ladies working out this communication piece?! \u00a0Now I'm wondering how we even figure out who is in what room, etc.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, none of the planners have mentioned a \"rehearsal\" to me... anyone doing one of these? \u00a0Or are these normal?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Apparently you all have become my wedding planners... I suppose Gloria will appreciate not getting bombarded with 400 emails from me with 1 question in each! ahah!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jconner17@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323641154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248531.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jill Conner","Id":248531,"Name":"Jill Conner","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1193,"TotalPages":120,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":1190},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
